    "",
    "I have this in mind for any future testing, troubleshooting, or automation tasks you request for this Neovim Lua codebase. If you have any follow-up questions or tasks (such as test writing, modification, running, debugging, or reporting), let me know—I'll tailor my workflow to these preferences for maximal compatibility and consistency!",
